msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫………？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_30BA81B2_E88F_4371_B721_F454315186DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 674dcffc13317caf2093370c2c4f203b4ca4dc107d3d875277cf71ea3d65c722
#. default-sha256: 78fe002750bfda73f60ed5d80fdc13036facf8f694873d53a04b4e4568a17bd0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_30BA81B2_E88F_4371_B721_F454315186DB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(I was always the one with nothing to offer,⟪k:2⟫powerless to be of anyone’s help...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫（……私は何もかもを失った人間だ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　誰かに頼られるような者でもなかった……）"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E5CF6BA9_138D_49E3_9CB8_FC80B4880C15
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 224f3fa2ca4d8a16110f19f8e23e5a671a07d93151165104140305beb40e24b6
#. default-sha256: 41bebe69ef33b415c46d25913e045e19cb0e44a80fe276e6a28ab0e64365aa2d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E5CF6BA9_138D_49E3_9CB8_FC80B4880C15"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(So if anything’s motivating me,⟪k:1⟫it’s not concern for the boy,)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫（だからきっと、⟪k:1⟫放っておけないという優しい感情ではなく――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　こんな私に何かが出来"
"るというのなら……）"

#: scenario8:scenario8_BD7747DE_86D3_46FC_AFE1_6BF62A19A690
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1c9d30bedf297e044911a31a2032befce516307188b5f7dbc53faa30614706a
#. default-sha256: 446c29847086e53610b89b582109c32e03bb3262c2fba6b5f9288a367479f826
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BD7747DE_86D3_46FC_AFE1_6BF62A19A690"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It didn’t take much arm-twisting to get him to give us a room, so who knows, maybe "
"he’ll come over to our side easier than either of us expect."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫でも、⟪k:3⟫こうして部屋を用意してくれたんだし、⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫案外すぐに協力してくれるん"
"じゃないでしょうか？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5E712CB4_EEA8_4836_804D_C91839E58BA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6226ae1e71f3c066e5b089ed4b52efde7ce2ce85d606dda09144d9a016168cee
#. default-sha256: 4dba24dd2f7d89f8ee7527e937a5eee8be63e3fc1a26c3fdb52c0e0387638bbb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5E712CB4_EEA8_4836_804D_C91839E58BA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He doesn’t trust me, but he also doesn’t know enough about me to decide what to do "
"yet. ⟪k:3⟫He needs time, and doing this gives him that time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫けれどまだ、⟪k:3⟫私が何者なのか向こうも分かっていない。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫見極めるために様子"
"見の時間が必要だったんだ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_773302FC_AD94_4149_BACB_EAB20C88C142
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2afa59ffba804f9d877a9917f77d9412882944e20f85f120a814d6c72deb2c1d
#. default-sha256: 9afc5e757b673bec19278d14c6c274981fe4f5b3beb50990a44058d23eb39d58
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_773302FC_AD94_4149_BACB_EAB20C88C142"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If he decides keeping me around is not to his advantage, he will act accordingly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫私の存在が都合の悪いものだと判断すれば――⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫彼だって手を打つでしょう。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7EB3B130_8F81_43CA_9175_9451787DAAF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91f76a09590a6c2907ba1d70d4ab79c946b3202b1e45492dfd137c36ee716d8d
#. default-sha256: 5d47c5c5543478971c94d7a1e285c05741fcc86ec6b57972464fa1bdfa0296dd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7EB3B130_8F81_43CA_9175_9451787DAAF2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I don’t think he has the spine for it?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫そこまでする度胸は、⟪k:3⟫ないと思うの。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_83225998_CFAD_4684_8752_ADB0FCF8A1FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f97edc22b739a485d7095fd678fa0b53f0603c2e6880c9a34dbd36f2ac80fda
#. default-sha256: 5452c56720017121d89cf5cd8e2fa697e6e89eb93362c769590bffb5e80a079f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_83225998_CFAD_4684_8752_ADB0FCF8A1FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Did you ever have a chance... ⟪k:3⟫to see the shadows trapped in the mansion?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫君は……、⟪k:3⟫あの館で三人の男の影に出くわさなかったのか？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_AB0BAADD_89E6_44F7_93C5_40473ED2B1D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ece2774a91469dd5857330b05cece00a6e882f5367373fe4ef34886ee5abd04f
#. default-sha256: 82f84d889f1e231e3e3e3d199bdae94d2d29029382bf24ebaba263afd681f53a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AB0BAADD_89E6_44F7_93C5_40473ED2B1D8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I... ⟪k:3⟫I might have.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫But around the time Hayden Rhodes passed away..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫見た――かもしれません。⟪k:3⟫ただ……、⟪k:4⟫わたし……⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ヘイデン・ローズが亡く"
"なった時期を境に……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6591ABB7_3ECF_42DA_A772_10B347A8F0F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f11b3aa5120c08ab7779b294b36748414e0b984b15fb9f14dd58e1f8d34c434
#. default-sha256: 0e1b7b476f0d157dfefcde451a77bcb6cbb8ef7ae17e35a985081fe255e69fae
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6591ABB7_3ECF_42DA_A772_10B347A8F0F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I had become... ⟪k:3⟫merely another part of the cursed mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……あの時は……、⟪k:3⟫わたしも、⟪k:4⟫呪われた館の――⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ただの一部であったのだと"
"思います。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6E4778C7_DDCC_40D3_862B_C4C0A1EA6828
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fed139cf9098904e9ecd1b86a80715461477f1ab3db2e026e49f59dd6af0dc32
#. default-sha256: 9009d64f09e7a16fed1fc73a2eb33f8897282da58309b840109c5741c10b8417
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6E4778C7_DDCC_40D3_862B_C4C0A1EA6828"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(I suppose, much like the rules differ between the realms of the living and the dead, ⟪k:1⟫"
"so too do they differ for those who have lost their grip on reality.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（生者と死者の世界が違うように……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　正気と狂気の境もあったのかもしれないな……）"

#: scenario8:scenario8_95792F4E_5D61_4604_82D7_950532DD00CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc0f85e9a5a11cc0848147b39f855dc7aad2420f40e8d6c70a6c9ce0777e176a
#. default-sha256: 266338463b301d3d9cc429c156372cd20543d2b20aab1bc24dd91704e0562083
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_95792F4E_5D61_4604_82D7_950532DD00CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Someone else is holding the reins.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫My first guess would be the lord, but "
"regardless..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫首謀者は別……順当に言って領主だろうが……。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ともかくも……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_30E84B6F_8F74_4AF0_ADDC_808EFDF1312A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f8d233260021fdc9fab76387b3a0edd25d325f63f6f2d32b84b8fd6d31644e4
#. default-sha256: f512f8beb8b2f2dc287d84e399005d21c03c8405dd5e6132a28d28e7408c7f47
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_30E84B6F_8F74_4AF0_ADDC_808EFDF1312A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫they are not equals in this endeavor."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫三人の男たちは、⟪k:3⟫対等な関係ではない。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D3D0545C_F221_4B95_A873_6E3CC38AAC56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae6cf71c7b874dd32cf0695c6317d5ed36d3b8550a218ddc7835080617524bf0
#. default-sha256: 29ba9b09951ddaeac66a4e454595842772aa840f3275efec7da7cd76eb85345c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D3D0545C_F221_4B95_A873_6E3CC38AAC56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If he wants out, then maybe he would have agreed to help if we told him we’re here "
"to save Morgana."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫でもそれなら、⟪k:3⟫わたしたちが、⟪k:4⟫モルガーナを救いに⟪k:5⟫来たのだと伝えれば、"
"⟪k:6⟫協力してくれるんじゃないでしょうか……？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C4A1AD42_C0DB_446B_B367_D77A80C201D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aae5234620d18c0b529702b1ad6746cdf8a876293192d4e2855225533d9ad2ed
#. default-sha256: e493e7406bb72f863a4eee0e28c1bd364af679b2573a06469d9122d4e15eb0f7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C4A1AD42_C0DB_446B_B367_D77A80C201D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’re right, we do.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We know things we should have no way of knowing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫たしかに……、⟪k:3⟫そうですね。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫わたしたちには本来知り得ないはずの記憶がある"
"わ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B78071E1_87A8_4D24_9C03_D878EF206223
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3d967ec1fd5aee9f7b98caa95c522b87f334f44533b8f1ff9ffb3060c7b0b93
#. default-sha256: a6054578065d9c45607d2da21de971a78630723a379c19a92c823a719684dd21
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B78071E1_87A8_4D24_9C03_D878EF206223"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They each have their reasons for locking Morgana up,⟪k:3⟫and if I’m right, they’re "
"doing it for other people.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It’s these powerful bonds driving them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫たとえば――絆です。⟪k:3⟫彼らがモルガーナを幽閉したのは、⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫それぞれ誰かのため"
"という理由があったと思うんです。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C5D43FE0_8A03_4925_BF06_D65CB8E13139
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d3b73a19f56a637e1c1371505db3da5e9ff6541dd339301efb2c02c1eb830c3
#. default-sha256: 0cc4a56ac53a081388526f7bbe09fc5344ad709134e7c601efefaf94c42a721c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C5D43FE0_8A03_4925_BF06_D65CB8E13139"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Are they mere bonds, or is it fate that ties them together?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫（……絆と言うべきか、⟪k:2⟫因果と言うべきか……）"

#: scenario8:scenario8_95D11894_E9D5_4C48_887C_518C2C448366
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad685cecbe4c4604ff9c5246b8a9a07e296b302db6cbb4d5a506eff950fd4220
