"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Putting ourselves out like that is only going to get us unwanted attention, make people "
"suspicious,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫不用意に目立つ動きをすれば、⟪k:2⟫妙な疑いもかかるし――"

