msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I turn my gaze back toward the nun to find her kneeling in one of the pews. She bows "
"her head and begins to whisper a prayer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫――視線を修道女に戻す。⟪k:2⟫彼女はちょうど、⟪k:3⟫長椅子に腰を下ろし、⟪k:4⟫祈りの言葉を呟"
"き始めたところだった。"

