"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(I can ask her about Saint’s Blood some other time...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And while I have a "
"number of questions about the man she’s close with too, right now, Mell’s sister is priority.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫（聖女の血を問うのは、⟪k:2⟫今は置いておこう……。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　彼女には例の男についても聞き"
