msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And with how sick she can get, she doesn’t spend much time outside. ⟪k:2⟫Which is a "
"shame, because she’s such a sweet little girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫とっても明るくて、⟪k:2⟫いい子なんだけどね。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫病気がちっていうのもあるから、⟪k:5⟫"
