msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The trek is a reminder of just how inconvenient my body always was. ⟪k:2⟫And having "
"this chance to experience being “alive” again..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫改めて、⟪k:2⟫自分の体質の厄介なところを見せ付けられた思いだった。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫生者の感覚を"
"取り戻すということは――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5B651B86_1562_48A5_BC1C_93E2750BD3AE
